# Ignore everything
*

# Allow files and directories
!/cmd
!/internal
!/librobne
!/migrations
!/go.mod
!/go.sum
!/rosocp.go
!/openapi.json
!/resource_optimization_openshift.json

# vendor/ is excluded on purpose: image `go build` uses go.mod
# `replace => ./librobne`, not the vendor copy. Hermetic/offline builds that
# COPY vendor/ (or add `!/vendor` here) compile vendored librobne instead —
# keep it in sync with ./librobne (`make vendor-librobne-check`). Do not mix
# vendor/ from one commit with librobne/ from another (#510).
